<title>USA: Flamingo Casino gets OK to move to Shreveport, La.</title>
<headline>Flamingo Casino gets OK to move to Shreveport, La.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS, La. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flamingo Casino-New Orleans said Friday it had received approval from Louisiana gaming regulators to move its casino to Shreveport.</p>
<p>The casino, which is half owned by Hilton Hotels Corp and 50 percent owned by New Orleans Paddlewheels Inc, is expected to move in mid to late 1997.</p>
</text>
